{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push Defense is a push puzzle game with tower defense aspects powered by the Godot engine. Five distinct modes make up push defense and each mode will give you unique and engaging challenges.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push Defense will have the players choose between one of five distinct game modes each with its own challenges and obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through 15+ levels in the campaign solving push puzzles of increasing difficulty and theme as you along.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play endless levels in endless mode.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 10+ waves of enemies in tower defense mode push towers into place to aid you in your defense.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the labyrinth of obstacles to avoid or deal with enemies in your way in the game mode crush.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower placement is a game mode all about where you place towers to better deal with the coming onslaught of enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These five distinct game modes will make up the entire player experience as they try this fresh spin on the push puzzle genre.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"CAMPAIGN LEVEL 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875710/6398a9488790293dfccc5987992e4676fe84c067.jpg"},{"name":"CAMPAIGN LEVEL 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875710/6398a9488790293dfccc5987992e4676fe84c067.jpg"},{"name":"CAMPAIGN LEVEL 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875710/6398a9488790293dfccc5987992e4676fe84c067.jpg"},{"name":"CAMPAIGN LEVEL 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875710/6398a9488790293dfccc5987992e4676fe84c067.jpg"},{"name":"CAMPAIGN LEVEL 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommu